1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,310
One more mistake, and I die in a cell.

2
00:00:02,624 --> 00:00:04,530
So why am I holding his silver?

3
00:00:05,096 --> 00:00:06,330
We're closed.

4
00:00:06,654 --> 00:00:07,830
The sign says open.

5
00:00:07,999 --> 00:00:08,870
Not for you.

6
00:00:16,804 --> 00:00:17,270
Eat.

7
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,490
Nobody here asks what you did. You should.

8
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:27,240
Sorry, Father.

9
00:00:29,727 --> 00:00:30,940
Stolen from a church?

10
00:00:31,471 --> 00:00:32,000
Given.

11
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,360
He forgot the lighter.

12
00:00:33,761 --> 00:00:34,780
Be someone else.

13
00:00:36,727 --> 00:00:38,810
Twenty-four six-oh-one.

